Published `sc.videos` to PyPI and `@simplesconsultoria/volto-videos` to npm from a GitHub Actions workflow with trusted publishing, run when a GitHub release is published, instead of from `repoplone release`. Moved the Dependabot configuration to `.github/dependabot.yml`, where GitHub reads it, and skipped the change log check for Dependabot pull requests and those labeled `skip changelog`. @ericof
